{"id":"4749ed189a9a04e5","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-tait-dual.md","title":"Tait 对偶","display":"df-tait-dual — Tait 对偶","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-tait-dual","aliases":["18-df-tait-dual"],"display":"df-tait-dual — Tait 对偶","depends_on":["[[18-df-tait-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definition 4.3.1 (first-order clauses)","source_pages":"53","source_pdf_pages":"63","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-tait-dual"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-tait-dual</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tait-dual — Tait 对偶"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"050c95095a2d9bab\" href=\"?note=050c95095a2d9bab\" title=\"18-df-tait-formula\">18-df-tait-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 4.3.1 (first-order clauses)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"53"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"63"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\\in\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\">\\(F,G\\in\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，均取自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050c95095a2d9bab\" href=\"?note=050c95095a2d9bab\" title=\"18-df-tait-formula\">18-df-tait-formula</a>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim:\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\\to\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\">\\(\\sim:\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\\to\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\sim A&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg A,&amp;\\quad\\sim(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\sim(F\\land G)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\sim F\\lor\\sim G),&amp;\\sim(F\\lor G)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\sim F\\land\\sim G),\\\\\n\\sim(\\forall x F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,\\sim F,&amp;\\sim(\\exists x F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\sim F.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\sim A&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg A,&amp;\\quad\\sim(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\sim(F\\land G)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\sim F\\lor\\sim G),&amp;\\sim(F\\lor G)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\sim F\\land\\sim G),\\\\\n\\sim(\\forall x F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,\\sim F,&amp;\\sim(\\exists x F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\sim F.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源为 Definition 4.3.1 的一阶部分。语法树严格缩短，故结构递归唯一；归纳得到双重对偶回到原式。对偶让复合否定保留在 Tait 语言内，不能把复合 ¬F 当作新的基本构造子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-tait-formula","status":"resolved","id":"050c95095a2d9bab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-tait-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-tait-formula","status":"resolved","id":"050c95095a2d9bab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，$F,G\\in\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$，均取自 [[18-df-tait-formula]]。定义 $\\sim:\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\\to\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"F,G\\in\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim:\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\\to\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\sim A&\\coloneqq\\neg A,&\\quad\\sim(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\sim(F\\land G)&\\coloneqq(\\sim F\\lor\\sim G),&\\sim(F\\lor G)&\\coloneqq(\\sim F\\land\\sim G),\\\\\n\\sim(\\forall x F)&\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,\\sim F,&\\sim(\\exists x F)&\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\sim F.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1205,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-tait-dual]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-tait-dual]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-tait-dual]]"}],"outgoing":["050c95095a2d9bab"]}